r  the royal family took to social media to  congratulate the couple  and a source previously told et that  while they made a coordinated public  effort to congratulate and offer harry  and megan well wishes  there are still lingering feelings of  disappointment and anger  after the couple's claims in their  explosive oprah interview  where they accused and unnamed member of  the royal family  of expressing concern about the  potential color of their son archie's  skin  before he was born i think everyone's  hope is that this  little baby is going to be a rift healer  because this family division has really  gone on for  a very long time now it's well over a  year we know that there have been some  really quite deep problems between harry  and william  difficulties between harry and his  father and i think it's everyone's  hopes that this little baby will will be  a peace offering  in many ways and that she will help to  bring this divided family  back together  you

